{
    "title": "The Fresh Market",
    "description": "Discover all your favorite foods, all in one place! Browse your local store\u2019s items, from exceptional meat and seafood to seasonal produce, easy meals and entertaining essentials. Build shopping lists, check out weekly specials and more. You\u2019ll never shop The Fresh Market the same way again!\r\n\r\nDelicious on Demand\r\nExplore new items, delicious favorites and more. Wherever you go, whenever you like! \r\n\r\nScan & Shop \r\nLook up items via barcode to see if we carry them.\r\n\r\nBuild & Share Lists\r\nMake lists you can\u2019t lose, so you\u2019ll never forget an item (like that lime you needed for your famous guacamole). We\u2019ve also made it easy for you to share your lists with others. \r\n\r\nRe-Order Favorites\r\nEasily re-order your favorite products for delivery. \r\n\r\nEnjoy Weekly Savings\r\nStay up to date on the latest weekly features and deals.",
